        "subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> defines the red fox's appearance: its face, orange-red winter coat, white chest and throat, black legs and black-tipped ears, and bushy tail with a white tip.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The same fox trots through fresh snow in a birch forest at golden hour.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1>: fully_preserved - retain the fox's face, coat markings, ears and body proportions while allowing a new pose and motion.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] From 0.0 s to 5.2 s, a low tracking shot at eye level follows the fox trotting left to right through knee-deep snow. Its breath steams; each paw sinks into the powder and kicks up fine crystals in the warm backlight. White birch trunks pass in soft focus behind it. The camera glides alongside at a steady pace. Photoreal live action.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSnow crunches softly under each paw, wind moves through the bare branches, and a bird calls in the distance.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
